I'll never be able to return again, I suppose.

318
00:46:44,612 --> 00:46:53,112
君が手を差し伸べた　光で影が生まれる
Where you extended your hand, light casts a shadow.

319
00:46:55,612 --> 00:47:00,612
歌って聞かせて　この話の続きを
Sing and let me hear the rest of this story.

320
00:47:01,612 --> 00:47:10,612
ずっと連れていってみたことない星まで
Always take me with you, to stars we've never seen before...

321
00:47:18,112 --> 00:47:24,112
誰の手も声も届かない　高くそびえ立った塔の上へ
To the top of the towering spire where no one's hands or voices can reach.

322
00:47:24,612 --> 00:47:30,112
飛ばす風船かすら　僕は君に笑ってほしいんだ
Even the balloons we let fly... I just want you to smile.

323
