324
00:47:36,612 --> 00:47:41,112
これまでを埋めてきたけど
Though we've filled in the time until now,

325
00:47:41,612 --> 00:47:47,112
退屈な日々を蹴散らして　君と二人で
Kicking away these tedious days, together with you,

326
00:47:48,612 --> 00:47:53,612
この街中を泳げたら
If we could swim through this whole town,

327
00:47:54,612 --> 00:48:02,612
